{
  "_readme": [
    "Live control-room I/O, keyed by the Unity definition UID (SwitchDefinition /",
    "GaugeDefinition -> Inspector -> three dots -> Generate New ID).",
    "switches:   inputs - the client reports the position it is in.",
    "indicators: outputs - lamp state on a switch, keyed by that SWITCH's uid.",
    "gauges:     outputs - the server sets the value, the client's needle follows.",
    "Entry shapes (see API.md for the full field list):",
    "  switch    {\"uid\": \"...\", \"id\": \"RCP_1_POWER\", \"name\": \"RCP 1 Power\", \"positions\": [\"off\", \"on\"], \"position\": \"off\", \"powered\": true, \"available\": true}",
    "  indicator {\"uid\": \"...\", \"id\": \"RCP_1_LAMP\", \"name\": \"RCP 1 Lamp\", \"state\": \"green\", \"flashing\": false}",
    "  gauge     {\"uid\": \"...\", \"id\": \"RCP_1_HZ\", \"name\": \"RCP 1 Speed\", \"units\": \"Hz\", \"minValue\": 0.0, \"maxValue\": 80.0, \"value\": 0.0, \"valid\": true}",
    "With autoRegisterFromClients on, switches the client reports but this file",
    "doesn't have are added here automatically (the file is rewritten)."
  ],
